    "body": "Adds two positive Boolean source specimens through the real public Core1/Core2 checker and complete Program comparisons. This is the independent main delivery of the eight fixture/test files from PR250, plus only their seven-line guideline convention.\n\nValidation: one selected Rust test passed on the header integration base; four real CLI processes exited 0 with complete frozen output matches, and both complete 21-node Programs matched. All886 source pins bind the tested working tree to `ce7d16557fc0605f929357628d907d2a66d6153c`. The pre-execution expectations remain unchanged and explicitly disclose implementation-source exposure.\n\nFresh whole nine-file source/result review is pending. Static admission and serialization only: no action execution, independent financial/work oracle, compiler Artifact, proof or ledger acceptance. All27 constructor obligations remain open.\n\nBased on PR252 to avoid pulling the pending financial/help/docs stack. After PR252 merges, retarget to main. PR250 can be closed as superseded only after this delivery actually merges; its original history and qualified review remain preserved.\n",
